### CREATE GAME
POST http://localhost:8080/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "11",
  "name": "game1",
  "owner-user-id": "1"
}

### DESCRIBE GAME
GET http://localhost:8080/games/11
Accept: application/json

### LIST ALL GAMES
GET http://localhost:8080/games
Accept: */*
Cache-Control: no-cache

### UPDATE GAME
PUT http://localhost:8080/games/11
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "game1-updated",
  "owner-user-id": "1"
}

### DELETE USER
DELETE http://localhost:8080/games/11
Content-Type: application/json

### JOIN GAME
POST http://localhost:8080/games/11:join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user-id": "2"
}